- op: discuss  # cc3d
  at: '2026-03-06T16:12:54Z'  # cc3d
  by: agent  # cc3d
  actor: jgstern_agent  # cc3d
  clock: 10  # cc3d
  nonce: cc3d  # cc3d
  message: "Done in PR #1856. Implementation: simple first-pass filter (all open PRs >6h), then the guidance text gives the agent nuanced options (merge/rebase/fix/close) as a second pass. Kept CI status detection simple — just includes the 'mergeable' flag from the API response, no custom CI polling logic. The audit is non-fatal: if the API call fails (no connectivity, bad token), it silently skips. Tested manually: found 4 stale tracker-sync PRs."  # cc3d
